  "hindi": "प्रज्वलित अग्नि, पृथिवी पर स्थापित, सब भुवनों की ओर मुख किए खड़ा हुआ है। होता, पावक, पुरातन काल से, अत्यन्त बुद्धिमान् देव — वह योग्य अग्नि देवों का यजन करे।",
  "english": "Kindled, Agni, set down on the earth, has stood facing all the beings. The Hotṛ priest, the purifier, from of old, the very wise god — let Agni, the worthy one, worship the gods.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "pradivaḥ taken as adverb 'from of old' (abl. of pradiv). pratyaṅ 'facing' could also be read as 'towards (all beings)' with asthāt.",
  "confidence": "high"
 },
