  "hindi": "नराशंस, धामों को अभ्यंजित करता हुआ, अपनी महिमा से तीनों द्युलोकों की ओर, उज्ज्वल ज्वाला वाला; घृत छिड़कने वाले मन से हव्य को भिगोता हुआ, यज्ञ के शीर्ष पर देवों को भली प्रकार अभ्यंजित करे।",
  "english": "Narāśaṃsa, anointing the abodes, bright-flamed, (reaching) towards the three heavens with his greatness; wetting the oblation with his ghee-sprinkling mind, let him anoint the gods together at the head of the sacrifice.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "'prati tisro divaḥ ... mahnā' has no verb of its own; 'reaching' is supplied in brackets. svarciḥ = su-arciḥ. mūrdhan read as endingless locative.",
